  "slug": "loaded-tofu-bean-breakfast-bowl",
  "name": "Loaded tofu and black bean breakfast bowl",
  "description": "Crumbled firm tofu scrambled with cumin over warmed black beans, red bell pepper and onion, finished with salsa and lime — a loaded breakfast bowl large enough for a high morning target.",
  "iconKey": "bowl_dash",
  "instructions": [
    "Warm the olive oil in a large pan and soften the chopped onion and the red bell pepper over medium-high heat for 3 minutes.",
    "Crumble the tofu into the pan, add the ground cumin and the salt, and scramble for 4 minutes until hot and lightly golden.",
    "Stir the drained black beans through and heat for 2 minutes more.",
    "Tip everything into a large bowl, spoon the salsa over and squeeze the lime on top."
